📜 THE PHYSICAL RULES OPEN-SOURCE PROTOCOL (V2.0)
Core Axiom: Logic must be self-consistent; Physics must be reproducible.

1. Conditional Free Use & Propagation
All physical derivations, deadlock logic trees, and architectural topologies in this repository and associated publications are granted free of charge to any individual or entity globally for reading, modification, and commercial use, subject strictly to the terms below.

2. Absolute Anti-Patent Mandate
It is strictly prohibited to apply for any form of patent, trade secret, or exclusive intellectual property right based directly or indirectly on the physical topologies, derivations, or system architectures found in this repository.

3. Legal Retaliation & Automatic Forfeiture
Any entity that uses the contents of this protocol automatically agrees to the terms herein. If any entity violates the Anti-Patent Mandate by filing for a patent, the following legal deadlocks are triggered automatically:
(a) All free usage rights granted to the violating entity are immediately terminated. Any subsequent commercial application based on this repository constitutes malicious copyright infringement.
(b) The author reserves the right to immediately publicize the entity's malicious patent squatting to global open-source foundations and the industry, placing them on a permanent open-source blacklist.
(c) The author reserves the right to initiate global patent invalidation challenges. All commit histories and publication timestamps in this repository serve as absolute prior art to nullify their patents.

4. Physical Backfire & Disclaimer
The author provides a multi-dimensional causal topology, not a step-by-step engineering blueprint. The contents reveal absolute physical extremes such as thermodynamic limits and quantum tunneling deadlocks.
Mandatory Warning: If you or your team blindly apply the topologies in this repository to build rockets, tape out chips, or train large models with only a half-understanding and without verifying the underlying system physics, any resulting physical catastrophes are entirely and physically the responsibility of the user. The author assumes zero liability.

5. No Engineering After-Sales
Since it is free, there is no customer service. If you cannot understand it, or if you need specific engineering implementation parameters, refer to the Tyrant Protocol with a base price of 1,000,000 USD per topic.

📜 物理规则开源协议 (V2.0)
核心公理：逻辑必须自洽，物理必须可复现。

第一条 附条件免费使用与传播
本仓库及关联文章的所有物理推演、死锁逻辑树、架构拓扑图，以附条件免费的形式授予全球任何个人或实体进行阅读、修改与商业使用的权利，严格受限于以下条款。

第二条 绝对专利禁止
严禁将本仓库中的任何物理拓扑、推导逻辑、系统架构直接或间接地申请为任何形式的专利、商业机密或独占性知识产权。

第三条 法律反制与自动违约
任何实体在使用本协议内容时，即自动同意本条款。若任何实体违反专利禁止条款擅自申请专利，将立即触发以下法律死锁：
（一）该实体获得的一切免费授权立即自动终止。其后续任何基于本仓库拓扑的商业应用，均构成对本作者著作权的恶意侵权。
（二）本作者保留立即向全球开源基金会及全行业公开其恶意抢注行为的权利，并将其永久列入开源黑名单。
（三）本作者保留对其发起全球范围专利无效宣告的权利。本仓库的所有提交记录与发布时间戳，均构成剥夺其专利权的绝对在先技术证据。

第四条 物理反噬与免责红线
作者提供的是多维立体因果拓扑，而非单一的工程图纸。本仓库内容揭示的是热力学极限、量子隧穿死锁等绝对物理极值。
强制警告：若任何实体在一知半解、缺乏底层系统验证的情况下，直接生搬硬套本仓库拓扑去造火箭、流片或训练大模型，因此导致的一切物理级灾难（如火箭爆炸、流片良率归零、集群热失控），百分之百由使用方自行承担全部物理后果。作者概不负责。

第五条 无工程售后
既然免费，即无客服。若无法理解内容，或需获取具体工程落地参数，请参阅《霸王协议》，单项课题基础标价为一百万美元。
